{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0183_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b8a196a0110e512633ce96e9fd182b1bd9497481b157dd9adab8e6ba0fb51cf9", "ja": "（茜達のハロウィンイベントが無事に終わった。\n引き続きCMも決まったし、これで……ん？）", "zh": "（茜她们的万圣节活动顺利结束了。\n广告也定下来了，这样一来……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0183_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "2e12c53109e8cd0e37176360f81c8550e14c93059535997892174d2e3e728928", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、\n人生ってさ、辛い選択の連続なんだね……。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n人生啊，就是接二连三痛苦的抉择呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0183_1002_p", "source_sha256": "328ee4fe1da4ee2d6ba43ed633e3570aa02d60cc2ca05ceadafc51bec849d88a", "ja": "どうかしたのか？　茜。\n何か悪いものでも食べたのか？", "zh": "怎么了？茜。\n该不会是吃了什么不好的东西吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0183_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "3a5605119de69ebf563401520dce51ae2ae3df3fafb77cbd987be896086c3081", "ja": "ううん。食べるのはこれから！\nだからこそ、茜ちゃんは悩んでいるのだよ！", "zh": "不对，接下来才要吃呢！正因为如此，小茜才会烦恼啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0183_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6d73fa1d3af406b01721e836bd20ce5b7a89a73bda015d28e04d9ba362bc2e64", "ja": "と言われても、話が見えないんだけど……。", "zh": "就算你这么说，我还是没听明白……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0183_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "5eaa75091ce07b5d2dfeafd126d0380a1e18cdaf9680670aed7c1e0ec574db61", "ja": "ハードなレッスンとお仕事を終えた茜ちゃん。\n冷蔵庫のなかには、冷えたプリンがふたつ！", "zh": "结束了高强度的课程和工作，小茜。  \n冰箱里有两个冰镇布丁！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0183_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "cf3e14ea323d8feb3caac95cc31dafe03254a3faa536a1cb27d09276fb008702", "ja": "お口の中でとろける『とろとろプリン』と、\nこれでもか！という甘さの『デンジャラスプリン』……", "zh": "入口即化的『绵滑布丁』，以及甜到极致的『危险布丁』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0183_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "4672b38a97471a1e2d65d32622c282e79deecf242e217304f27f433d2eee7765", "ja": "茜ちゃんはいったいどちらを選択すべきなのか！\nそれを悩んでいるんだよ！", "zh": "小茜到底该选哪一个才好！我正在为这件事烦恼呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0183_1008_p", "source_sha256": "48004779f0345a8a7b6d761101dfcca422ad8abff3f0bf2e1fc5923da4015b85", "ja": "そんな事か……。どうせあとで食べるなら、\nどっちが先でも同じじゃないのか？", "zh": "就这点事啊……反正之后都要吃掉，先吃哪个不都一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0183_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "e568c1a86826886ac196fc399769d8f6ffa46709db9b0b16e447690e4f9dc184", "ja": "あっまーい！　甘いよ{$P$}ちゃん！\nプリンよりも甘いよ！", "zh": "好甜啊！{$P$}，你比布丁还甜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0183_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "93e952861cea6b81fa8ba5de705091648b452c2f69d15c8cbae0d7fb78523102", "ja": "茜ちゃんは、今回のお仕事で学習しました。\n安易な選択が、のちに後悔を生むということを……！", "zh": "小茜从这次工作中学到了。轻率的选择，最终会带来后悔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0183_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0fc2f252da1c64ab69c7659408ffb4073cc05338960644ac1f01be9cd8328683", "ja": "今回の仕事って、ハロウィンイベントか。\nそんな、後悔するような事があったか？", "zh": "这次的工作是万圣节活动啊。\n有发生什么会让人后悔的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0183_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "4ae1dc63ef5a42e5f6c016a5f76f8dfeb826dd04bd5a2e67f07455c2bfc33849", "ja": "あったんだよ！\nあとね、悩むことも大事なの！　たぶん！", "zh": "有过啊！\n还有，烦恼也是很重要的！大概吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0183_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "b7a13c87bfcf2b036e998a6dc5b68385a72eeb23e12747576c6d74332aaa4837", "ja": "……よし、決めた！　茜ちゃん、悩みに悩んで、\n今日はとろとろプリンにします！", "zh": "……好，决定了！小茜，纠结了又纠结，今天就选滑溜溜的布丁！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0183_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "771e46612bfb6f4b33e4555d1ca003ca7232be10a44cdfbb78d5d9708de9c4d8", "ja": "だからデンジャラスプリンのほうは、\n{$P$}ちゃんにあげるね♪", "zh": "所以危险布丁就送给{$P$}啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0183_1015_p", "source_sha256": "27e876050e0a7c0b9a5648ff075ce5c47ecee55d4b1d8c9b5504320f3c1a120f", "ja": "ありがとう。\nいいのか？　そんなに悩んでたプリンなのに……。", "zh": "谢谢。\n真的可以吗？明明是你那么纠结的布丁……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0183_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "b49219352729cf7f9668da487cd3f480571fafa1ffbb1a1631100c507e2e3664", "ja": "いいのいいの、今日の茜ちゃんは天使だからね♪\nそれじゃ、取ってくるねー！", "zh": "没事没事，今天的小茜可是天使哦♪\n那我这就去拿来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0183_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1c046b6669b564d11194192555683b1cee6e457309bf3ee93fddc5d59a902fc4", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう。……あれ？\nそういえばさっき、ゴミ箱に容器みたいなものが……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢。……咦？\n说起来，刚才垃圾桶里好像有个容器之类的东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0183_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "93f628aeec78b4239603f05a23cf46ceadb55e670654d43ea776a4b0d9e86240", "ja": "ギニャーーー！！？\nふたつともなくなってるー！？　ナンデ！？", "zh": "咿呀——！！？\n两个都不见了——！？为什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0183_1019_p", "source_sha256": "764f4e6a9d7cdb5b3e4aa49251f93533fc031371d5d8f4da4a3e2ac3627ece5c", "ja": "（やっぱり……。仕方ない、休憩がてら\n茜を連れて、コンビニにでも行くとしよう……）", "zh": "（果然……没办法，趁着休息，带着茜去趟便利店吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
